# Feature triad — global rules banner

Every feature under `docs/features/00N-*/` **must** include this exact reminder in **README.md**, **spec.md**, **plan.md**, and **tasks.md** (near the top, typically right after the title or Status):

```markdown
## Global rules

Ensure you adhere to our global rules in `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` and `.cursorrules`.
```

## When writing or updating triads

- New features (planner drafts + saved triad files): always include the section.
- Implementing a feature: re-read that banner plus `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` and `.cursorrules` (FE/BE separation, tests, atomic commits, pending docs).
- Do not invent alternate wording; keep the sentence above so agents and humans see one consistent instruction.
